<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="d1a6e774f69b4c41bb5ef05c5569017f">说明：名单库因子使用手册</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="4f06d33211a54e0785ef2ee64e9c6adb" />
<h1 nodeId="f5b5dd61a364497c8b7a2a12476c893b">1.背景</h1>
<p nodeId="d359299cf15c4724a6c9e5775490a000"><span font-size="19"><strong>Zeus与名单库的联动</strong></span></p>
<ul nodeId="3910f5b74a124ea7a5c6ecdba835d2c5">
<li nodeId="ac460f3aab164f5ebc36b55d4194eb9f">
<p nodeId="a6330e1c01b04a2f9d8068305dd9f5a0">在名单库联动的诉求中，主要分为策略查询名单库和策略写入名单库。首先要有一个名单库存储服务，再此基础上与引擎进行联动，查询服务通过因子（<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><strong>名单库因子</strong></span>）、写入服务通过决策（携带附加信息的决策）实现最终的联动；</p>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343731459?contentType=2&amp;isNewContent=false" width="832" height="224.19672131147541" nodeId="edc76b30cb5d48a4bb7dcd1b65481dda" />
<p nodeId="101ecdee1b784c6ca6a3ef17ef259f43" />
</li>
<li nodeId="02b50a7a660241c1bb6165ce6d4e95fe">
<p nodeId="20cecacd702544ab8b8d2aae87099d77"><strong>常用的特征逻辑封装</strong></p>
<p nodeId="5844c4fc061d43d7bd21b175f8f5ccef"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><strong>名单库因子：</strong></span>与名单库联动过程中将查询名单的逻辑进行封装；</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h1 nodeId="89a2d30c7b5746dd969c7a0043462553">2.操作说明</h1>
<h2 nodeId="d9d4ffd5f4f0419f9a2ce3882980c281">2.1 先在skywalker上创建名单库</h2>
<h3 nodeId="99e63655d33e47d685400243cce0cb6b">2.1.1 入口</h3>
<p nodeId="3b08807620734698b4404f35ab32f27b"><span font-size="19"><strong><a href="http://rc-skywalker.sankuai.com/risklist" title="Skywalker" nodeId="c208ec8b65aa4ec79aef266df0578d2f"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">Skywalker</span></a></strong></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">-数据产品-风控名单库-名单库管理-名单</span></p>
<p nodeId="7661efabb55048099a805eb9de1808ce"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343775941?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="836" height="443" nodeId="2d4b2efecacb42c98aa3107073d1e613" /></p>
<h3 nodeId="938a5dda8d1f4ec1947faf200a94dbf2">2.1.2 创建名单</h3>
<p nodeId="9de929e1f1564aa89ec9ac074f9339fe">点击 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">新建名单</span>，填写 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单名称</span> 和 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单说明</span>，点击 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">保存</span> 即可；</p>
