<p nodeId="40a569ad0bf04c369c0456ee1c621005" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[633]" nodeId="df936142189745808f857a9d261490d6">
<p nodeId="a6f5b19a22aa48428b376ba6240084d4"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343820259?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="603" height="417" nodeId="4ecbe2af81fd434395a3b9fddfd04786" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h3 nodeId="42e1561f818d4ba88c06ead077bc1e1b">2.1.3 添加名单配置</h3>
<p nodeId="6f9a61fd944c4eb8af949f28b14aea5c">（1）点击 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">添加名单配置</span>，填写<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单配置信息</span>；</p>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="6692a8e249704d7693ee734096c0be8d">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<ul nodeId="60f130e83ba24e8980f8a1e88fbdf095">
<li nodeId="d72c40eaadd84b80bc4aad7a28d7ceb6"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单名称：</span>选择上一步创建的名单库或已有名单库；</li>
<li nodeId="3722f815ce7441aab6e857fd9302c2b2"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">值类型：</span>根据不同的场景和规则选择相应的值类型；</li>
<li nodeId="b89f0d8e60e44102bca8823bdbc21d83"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单类型：</span>根据需求可选黑名单/白名单/灰名单；</li>
<li nodeId="20ba2d3ccd734b9e917ad283053b8942"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">风险等级：</span>依据风险程度选择风险等级；</li>
<li nodeId="e7f354d4c5e74180a656291e8e0b9c92"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">备注：</span>可以描述该名单的用法，方便复用；</li>
<li nodeId="7817f41e996c4878b5101cd88c2ec8b8"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">风控业务标签：</span>根据需求选择；</li>
<li nodeId="de718d519f324c9aa4181d0da2e4ec12"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">业务方标签：</span>根据具体业务方进行选择；</li>
<li nodeId="f4c2844d37aa47b484d0cb96c409d395"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单分类标签：</span>根据相应规则或场景进行选择；</li>
<li nodeId="5fd46ed132c743e99c40a8ede535931f"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">点击继续添加可以同时添加多条名单配置</span>；</li>
</ul>
</km-content>
</km-note>
