<p nodeId="d3e009c7d1fe41ddbfe342319edc92b5"><span color=" ">（2）建完名单库并配置好后可以查询到相应的记录：</span></p>
<p nodeId="d4e56055e2ff43b5983bbdc469486bcd"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343698429?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="1034" height="344" nodeId="da62e878b7684a88a62c27de0c6d5f8f" /></p>
<h2 nodeId="5a414bae491045758d08744118da8ddc">2.2 然后在Zeus上创建名单库因子</h2>
<h3 nodeId="d6e9bd993fad44e697096143d878fdcb">2.2.1 入口</h3>
<p nodeId="4a19e3ccfd3348aebb3114a240bfc8f8"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">规则-&gt;因子-&gt;添加因子</span></p>
<p nodeId="dd0a400b9e1d49079d80b9c3a94857fb"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343812707?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="662" height="402" nodeId="1a96b99835944e32b94ad483eaa26a6f" /></p>
<p nodeId="cdd3b0cf22f044abac0f7055433ff902" />
<p nodeId="35eb781c154c4263bbbfd569191ac539">2.2.2 填写名单库因子<span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">逻辑信息</span></p>
<p nodeId="019cedf3196c4a9091be6a8d8d7417b3">（1）<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">选择工具</span>-&gt;<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">扩展因子</span>-&gt;<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">拓展类型</span>-&gt;<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单库因子</span></p>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="94695fa0f3604549ae63861cf998c3ce">
<tr nodeId="77b360b10c9a49a18e154029f0f55a8a">
<td colwidth="[691]" nodeId="83a2985480a6489a974ef60f2d1b2011">
<p nodeId="e8cad41e083045ebb56ee0355e85d1ab"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343910116?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="662" height="252" nodeId="d2cc3a1b1aff4e49b7f9259c05c0c05a" /></p>
<p nodeId="2e705410f1dc4fa9b7c4b33d757d4772" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[848]" nodeId="f6f36a19f5764d23884f70c67562499c">
<p nodeId="f8848484b8354acd9b4b7947e0139f23"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343814606?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="819" height="314" nodeId="bb910d0e15a74d6c92b79db268977cbc" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p nodeId="e41012e70e324f8b8ac1fab5ead0102b">（2）填写名单库因子的其他逻辑信息，<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">红框部分（名单类型、风险类型、值类型、风险等级）必须与创建名单库的时候完全一致；</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">填写完成后，点击 </span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">下一步</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">；</span></p>
<km-note type="warning" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="20334c0b14db43e991cf0b97a5577d23">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<ul nodeId="09f917fe5900481893759b9767967ea4">
<li nodeId="9f2f999e959040bb81f39cd72f3c3692"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">中文名称：</span>名单库因子的中文解释，方便后续理解和查询；</li>
<li nodeId="67426039a1204bf88d521b898b9de161"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">英文名称：</span>名单库因子英文名（依据命名规则命名，例如账户安全人员在创建中的命名规则是：<strong>factor_account_user_场景_业务方需求_值类型</strong>，例如“酒店注册场景下反爬黑名单注册拦截”对应“factor_account_user_register_hotelMTSIAccount_mobile”；）</li>
<li nodeId="1833f317dac541f59950798d2ac63e6b"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">值表达式：</span>aviator表达式，此处为与名单库的值类型取匹配的参数（账户安全人员在创建过程中举例：例如名单库的值类型为userid那此处也应为userid；但<strong>此处有坑</strong>，注册场景下手机号的值表达式不为mobile，为user，因为注册场景下业务方传的参数是user而非mobile）；</li>
<li nodeId="47d2a57015814f71b085552849a19ca0"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">名单类型：</span>选对应名单库的名单类型；</li>
<li nodeId="ef8099414ca94bebb68968181991ae33"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">风险类型：</span>选对应名单库；</li>
<li nodeId="75fb460e88054ababbbcffbd7cc83be3"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">值类型：</span>选对应名单库的值类型；</li>
<li nodeId="b1438ed1b7c24f82abd404cbd475a81d"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">风险等级：</span>选对应名单库的风险等级；</li>
<li nodeId="5f9cd87c27924ae0a93b57d28c0b3b56"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">过期时间：</span>可选，按需求填写；</li>
</ul>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="b1a094c62c50434e896b57de7d3384a6"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343861944?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="1307" height="582" nodeId="59e6014b1ea145c19b8fd32fb446ef13" /></p>
<h3 nodeId="5d8a13402b964a3889e850c92e96d0fc">2.2.3 为创建的名单库因子添加测试用例</h3>
<p nodeId="672dccae1aa74a7985d1e036224c9203"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">填写测试信息</span>之后点击<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"> 添加测试用例</span>，测试<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">成功</span>后，点击 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">下一步</span>；</p>
<p nodeId="e3965edb96c147e48c6b503957524aa0"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343864822?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="1185" height="600" nodeId="a73429e80d974f56a99b65b74701a06d" /></p>
<h3 nodeId="5d88d5c8bd3744459c1223683597c0e3">2.2.4 填写名单库因子的属性信息</h3>
<p nodeId="f890e76781df48f1b48327f34840542f"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">按照需要</span>选择<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">共享给的业务方</span>并为该名单库因子<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">添加标签</span>，点击<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"> 完成</span> ，至此，名单库因子创建完成；</p>
<p nodeId="0b1d5561fd28471ab314dcda83cdf36f"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/339769403/343992757?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="1242" height="600" nodeId="2f966eab77dd48b8ab200f11ad10c1eb" /></p>
